Subject: [PATCH 1/3] 071 (1/3): BABAL at stu32-arcade 5947c16: SOFT1 and SOFT6
 also steer, 9, x and + jump; its new place

Michael's asks (abacus #8558): in play SOFT1 also steers left and SOFT6 right, and 9, x and
+ also jump beside 8 and ENTER; a side held by two keys steers as one. The rules are
babalcore's, unchanged. Babal now lives in stu32-arcade's games/babal (its manifest
games/babal/stu32-game.txt). device/standin/babal.txt still holds: soft key 2 picks a skill
on the title as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
